# Vite files
vite.config.js.timestamp-*
vite.config.ts.timestamp-*
.vite/

# Every device's own persisted config/state - boat_id.txt (src/boatIdFile.js),
# regatta-id.txt (src/regattaIdFile.js), mark-name.txt (src/markNameFile.js,
# README's "Mark mode"), power-schedule.txt (src/powerScheduleFile.js), the
# webhook retry queues' sqlite files, and course_marks.json (a boat's local
# cache of the last-broadcast course). All local to one physical unit/one
# operator's preferences, none of it ever something to commit or share
# between machines. Created on demand (fs.mkdirSync in src/config.js), so
# there's no need to keep an empty placeholder tracked just to make the
# directory exist in a fresh checkout.
race-config/

# Locally-generated race data. base-logs/ is the BASE's own received-fix
# CSV log; boat-logs/ is a BOAT's own chunked SD-card log - deliberately two
# separate directories, not one shared between roles (see config.js's own
# boatLogDir comment); base-uploads/ is where the base collects boats'
# uploaded copies of their own boat-logs/ files. All three are created on
# demand (fs.mkdirSync in baseStation.js/sdLogger.js/uploadServer.js), so
# there's no need to keep an empty placeholder tracked just to make the
# directory exist in a fresh checkout.
base-logs/
boat-logs/
base-uploads/
